Z||000000||DecadenceR||07-22-2001||10:55 PM||||Does the speedometer signal go through the ECM? Or would I be able to run wires from the sensor directly to the dash?<P>Also, does anyone knoe what color wires are for the speedo out of the dash? I would want to splice them right into the harness before it plugs into the cluster. Thanks!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||PBJ||07-22-2001||11:16 PM||||Speedo does not us ECM but goes directly from sensor in trans to dash.  Dash sends a signal to ECM then.||||reg||1
Z||000002||DecadenceR||07-23-2001||12:10 AM||||OK cool, so at least I know I can run direct wires. Now, does anyone know what color wires they are coming from the dash cluster?||||reg||1
Z||000003||87GTZ34||07-23-2001||12:16 AM||||From the VSS to the instrument cluster... the wires are purple/wht & yellow||||reg||1
Z||000004||DecadenceR||07-23-2001||02:37 AM||||Thank you very much. I may actually have a speedo tomorrow!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Jake_Dragon||07-23-2001||06:28 AM||||I just replaced my speedometer and my shift points are different plus now I feel guilty about how fast I have been going.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
